{"publicId":"7c93a473-4756-4ccb-9dfc-bf6255eccca2","title":"美国交通部因承包商升级通信系统宣布全国停飞致航班延误持续","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T11:34:02.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-14T11:34:02.000Z","digest":"美国交通部（FAA）因承包商L3Harris升级航空通信系统，于2026年11月14日宣布全国停飞，导致航班延误问题持续（Duffy周六声明）。此次升级旨在现代化航空通信网络，但操作未经充分测试，引发多州机场紧急关闭。停飞已造成至少3个月航班量下降40%，涉及美国航空、达美航空等12家航司及纽约、洛杉矶等8大枢纽机场，旅客滞留超50万人次。目前争议焦点在于承包商是否按合同完成测试，以及停飞决策是否符合安全标准。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-14T18:32:14.806Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"美国交通部因承包商升级L3Harris通信系统实施全国停飞","latestReport":{"id":"fjk8rlnhicag2f7fvlytejbow"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fwuvAXUrqgOA","title":"美国航班恢复但仍面临延误和取消","firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T11:34:02.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"fjk8rlnhicag2f7fvlytejbow","title":"美国交通部因承包商升级L3Harris通信系统实施全国停飞","summary":"美国交通部宣布全国停飞，因承包商升级L3Harris通信系统（Duffy周六声明）","source":{"name":"CNBC Top News","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T11:34:02.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"fjk8rlnhicag2f7fvlytejbow","title":"美国交通部因承包商升级L3Harris通信系统实施全国停飞","summary":"美国交通部宣布全国停飞，因承包商升级L3Harris通信系统（Duffy周六声明）","source":{"name":"CNBC Top News","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T11:34:02.000Z","selected":false}],"timeline":[{"id":"fjk8rlnhicag2f7fvlytejbow","title":"美国交通部因承包商升级L3Harris通信系统实施全国停飞","summary":"美国交通部宣布全国停飞，因承包商升级L3Harris通信系统（Duffy周六声明）","source":{"name":"CNBC Top News","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T11:34:02.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-14T13:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T15:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T16:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participant